M5Stack Tab5 — first hardware bring-up record
=============================================

Date        : 2026-11-14
Port        : /dev/ttyACM0 (USB-Serial/JTAG)
Chip        : ESP32-P4 rev v1.0, dual core 400 MHz, MAC 30:ed:a0:00:00:00
Flash/PSRAM : 16384 KB / 32768 KB
Firmware    : 4542864 B @0x10000 (69% of the 6.5 MB app slot), hash verified
Toolchain   : arduino-cli 1.2.0 (the copy embedded in Arduino IDE 2.3.6)
              + ~/.arduinoIDE/arduino-cli.yaml, fqbn m5stack:esp32:m5stack_tab5
Upload      : 18.3 s @ ~2.0 Mbit/s

Result: boots, panel lights up landscape at 1280x720, GT911 answers at 0x14,
Wi-Fi AP + web server come up, no panic and no reboot.

